    "reading_1_point_estimate": "K2 does not fire: 0 of 3 decision axes exceed Delta at the S=3 point estimate.",
    "reading_2_pessimistic_end_of_sigma_ci": "At the chi-square 97.5th-percentile end of each df=2 sigma interval, 1 of 3 decision axes would exceed Delta (['popqa']). The K2 rule needs >= 2, so this does NOT reach a fire.",
    "honest_summary": "Stage B removes Stage A's arm and budget objections but not its d.o.f. objection. The prereg does not define a Stage-B 'K2_CLEARED' state, so this script does not invent one; the terminal value it emits is the rule's own output.",
