    "integrity_beyond_the_loader": "load_cb asserts only 8/8 shard FILES: it has NO exact-item-count check and NO duplicate-item_id check (it merges into a dict). So prereg \u00a74's exact counts (triviaqa 17,944 / popqa 14,267 / nq_open 3,610) were unenforced for the closed-book axes until this script. Enforced here, outside the loader, because the loader is shared with A03's archived numbers and is not edited by this harvest.",
